From ce68370a85513f3335bc92cfe9d560464f5b6f4b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chenming Huang <quic_chenhuan@quicinc.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Jan 2025 08:49:28 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 11/13] AP: Add support for 2-link MLO configuration

Add support to generate correct link configuration for AP MLD case.
1. Defines ap_mlo_links to store different links' channel/bandwidth.
2. Both links share the same interface.
3. The ctrl_interface directory is different. First config uses default
directory as legacy case. Another config use a "_1" suffix.
4. Do not force the same mac address for MLD mac and bssid.

Change-Id: I90ba767d9facd2235b2c9b756e4a48a7e8f54028
Signed-off-by: Chenming Huang <quic_chenhuan@quicinc.com>
